  "remaining_integration_work": [
    "Implement the actual private fork composition over this topology: outer controller forks guardian; guardian adopts the prefork copy, creates the lease, forks broker and worker, and each process transitions to its exact final descriptor set.",
    "Bind generation-stable pidfds immediately after each fork and implement fixed waitid-based guardian, broker and worker reap without numeric-PID signaling or fallback waits.",
    "Implement the controller event loop over control, ledger, broker-report and worker-report endpoints, including READY verification before guardian arm, aggregate reservation before every CONTINUE, CONSUMED verification, final reports and terminal deadline cleanup.",
    "Integrate listener handoff/adoption, worker privilege drop and final seal, guardian-v2 authority consumption, full-size bootstrap/entry and authenticated source closure.",
    "Run a separately authorized bounded Linux native qualification before any real checkpoint payload read or import, then re-run unchanged host, input, resource and real-import admission."
  ],
